window.products.push({"id":165345,"name":"Travay Dryer Thermistor and Dryer Thermal Fuse Exact Fit for Whirlpool/kenmore/Maytag/Inglis Replace Partnumber: 3392519 8577274","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618+k+DNypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The fuse, thermistor are fail-safe that stops the electricity to the heating system when a dryer overheats. When this fuse is broken your dryer will not start or heat properly. This fuse self-destructs and cannot be reset, it must be replaced when there is no continuity between the terminals. The fuse has two terminals and is sold individually. It attaches to the blower wheel housing. Blown fuses can be caused by clogged ventilation and is recommended checking to make sure all the vents clear with proper air flow when you perform this repair. Compatible brands include: Whirlpool, kenmore,Amana, Inglia, Crosley * Package includes: 1 * Dryer Thermistor 1 * Dryer Thermal Fuse Replaces part numbers: - 8577274 Dryer Thermistor: 8577274, 3390292, 3406294, 3976615, 772546, AP3919451, AP6013514, ER8577274, PS993287, and PS11746740. - 3392519 Thermal Fuse: AP3132867, 2986, 3388651, 694511, 80005, AH345113, EA345113, ET401, PS345113. Fixes the following symptoms : 1. No heat or insufficient heat 2. Dryer is too hot 3. Dryer take to long to dry 4. Won't Start 5. The timer does advance 6. Shuts off too soon 7. Won't shut off 8. Will not tumble 9. Touchpad does not respond Travay Service Team: 24-hour pre-sale and after-sale service Free technical consultant Refund or exchange new replacement for unsatisfied order Please enter our shop,then click\"\" Have a question to ask\"\" if you have any puzzle !\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618+k+DNypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Travay","source_asin":"B08NSFT46Q","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-165345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NSFT46Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NSFT46Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
