window.products.push({"id":165416,"name":"Upgraded 4Pack 330031 Range Burner Receptacle Kit by Beaquicy - Replacement for Whirl-pool Ken-more Range/Stove - Replaces 814399 5303935058 530116773","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711e9ZR91ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ 𝑺𝑼𝑷𝑷𝑶𝑹𝑻 𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑹𝑬𝑻𝑼𝑹𝑵 & 𝑬𝑿𝑪𝑯𝑨𝑵𝑮𝑬- 𝑹𝑰𝑺𝑲-𝑭𝑹𝑬𝑬 𝑺𝑯𝑶𝑷𝑷𝑰𝑵𝑮. Beaquicy attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.If you have any quality problem during warranty period,please contact customer service in time.Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✦【Great Value 4-Pack 】-- 4 Pack 330031 Range burner receptacle kit includes 4 x plastic Receptacle Block,8 x high temp wire leads, 8x ceramic wire nuts, 8 x heat shrink insulator and 8 x metal brackets( two different metal brackets to match your old one,select the one for your situation). The kit is designed for use with ranges and cooktops. After the repair, all the burners will heat up faster and are easier to regulate temp.Price for a 4-pack is better value than purchasing individual units. ✦【Premium Quality】-- 330031 range burner receptacle kit is made of upgraded newest material-more durable stronger and wear-resistant than other's version.330031 terminal block kit are equivalent quality to the OEM Parts.When your element will not heat at all, or not heating properly it is likely an issue with the terminal block. You need to remove the element to replace this part. While you have the element out, inspect the element and the terminal for any corrosion, arcing, or discoloration. ✦【Compatible Design】--330031 Range Burner Surface Element Receptacle used for 𝑨𝒅𝒎-𝒊𝒓𝒂𝒍, 𝑭𝒓𝒊𝒈-𝒊𝒅𝒂𝒊𝒓𝒆, 𝑮-𝑬, 𝑴𝒂𝒚-𝒕𝒂𝒈, 𝑲𝒆𝒏-𝒎𝒐𝒓𝒆, 𝑹𝒐-𝒑𝒆𝒓, 𝑻𝒂𝒑-𝒑𝒂𝒏 𝒂𝒏𝒅 𝑾𝒉𝒊𝒓𝒍-𝒑𝒐𝒐𝒍 range models.Replaces Part#: 3374, AP3075808, PS340571, EAP340571, PD00002360, 814399.Please check the compatibility with your previous part and appliance's model before ordering this replacement. 𝑹𝒆𝒇𝒆𝒓 𝒕𝒐 𝒇𝒊𝒈𝒖𝒓𝒆 𝟔 & 𝟕 𝒇𝒐𝒓 𝒎𝒐𝒓𝒆 𝒄𝒐𝒎𝒑𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒃𝒍𝒆 𝒎𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔. ✦【DIY Installation】--Be careful to do DIY,check your power unpluged before repairing.Tend to clean the stove before installation to avoid further trouble.You will need a wire stripper and both a flat and Phillips screwdriver.You can also use a heat gun if you want to use the heat shrink in the kit. Best way to go.Do all the burner plugs in one go. Now you're cooking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711e9ZR91ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0BVLHMPWR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-165416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVLHMPWR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVLHMPWR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
