window.products.push({"id":165448,"name":"FSE MBB-6024G Bar Refrigerator, 60.75\" W x 24\" D x 35.5\" H, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715JH2QihIL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your drinks cold and readily accessible with this bar back cooler from FSE (Food Service Essentials). Perfect for any operation with bar service, this back bar refrigerator is the perfect place to chill bottles of beer and cider and to store kegs for later use. Built with a narrow frame, the unit is even sure to fit in cramped areas for convenience and space optimization. Plus, because it's outfitted with glass doors, the bar staff can immediately locate the required beverages or inventory their selection prior to restocking. Whether full of specialty options or popular customer favorites, this unit is engineered to support your business and make it easier to serve customers with the quality and attention you strive to provide. To monitor the temperature of the FSE MBB-6024G back bar refrigerator, a readout is provided on the digital display. Using an electronic thermostat, employees can adjust the temperature from 33° to 41° degrees Fahrenheit. The condenser is side mounted and can be accessed behind front grill when maintenance is needed or for easy cleaning. This unit cools with R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant. The FSE MBB-6024G bar refrigerator has LED lights in the cabinet that help employees locate specific product. Beverages are stored on four adjustable shelves, which are made of PVC coated wire so air flows uniformly through the cracks. This unit can hold 72 six-packs of 12-ounce cans, or up to 2 half-barrel kegs. Its glass doors offer a look inside the cabinet and can be locked to secure contents at the end of the night. Product Details: 15.8 cubic feet of interior space 15.8 cubic feet of interior space 24” narrow depth 24” narrow depth 2 sections with 2 glass doors 2 sections with 2 glass doors Locking doors seal shut Locking doors seal shut 12\" long recessed handles 12\" long recessed handles Temperature holding range: 33-41 degrees F Temperature holding range: 33-41 degrees F Electronic thermostat enables adjustments Electronic thermostat enables adjustments Digital display provides a readout LED interior lights facilitates product retrieval Digital display provides a readout LED interior lights facilitates product retrieval 4 adjustable wire shelves promote airflow 4 adjustable wire shelves promote airflow Accommodates (72) 6-packs of 12-oz. cans Accommodates (72) 6-packs of 12-oz. cans Interior and top made of corrosion-resistant stainless steel Interior and top made of corrosion-resistant stainless steel Stainless-steel countertop Stainless-steel countertop R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant R290 hydrocarbon refrigerant Dimensions: 60.75\"W x 24\"D x 35.5\"H Dimensions: 60.75\"W x 24\"D x 35.5\"H NEMA 5-15 plug Voltage/Herts/Phase: 115/60/1 NEMA 5-15 plug Voltage/Herts/Phase: 115/60/1 ETL listed ETL listed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715JH2QihIL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FSE","source_asin":"B09V9XGQVQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-165448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V9XGQVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V9XGQVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
