window.products.push({"id":165641,"name":"Garbage Disposal Air Switch Kit Dual Outlet Sink Top Waste Disposal On/Off Switch Kit Food and Waste Disposals Part (Plastic Long White Button) by CLE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JWlQ058zL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【HOW TO CHOOSE BUTTON】Choose the best fitting for your countertop. SHORT and LONG means the length of the air switch button, it depends on the thickness of the counter table you want to install on. In most cases, SHORT is for a stainless steel sink top and LONG is for thick countertop like granite, marble, quartz. The diameter of the countertop hole should be between 1 1/4\" and 1 3/4\". It is suitable for standard sinkhole for soap dispenser, otherwise you need to drill a hole by yourself. 【DUAL-OUTLETS DESIGN】Two outlets controlled by the air button together (one push on and one push off), a convenient alternative to a wall switch, easily mounts to the sink or counter top, & enables use of both instant hot water and a disposal from a single outlet. 【EASY&SAFE】No tools are required for installation, It's easy to install with the instruction of manual. No wires, just plug power module to use, no damage to your wall, eliminates additional drilling and tedious installation. The Power-supply Cords are attested by UL for security and long-term use. Suitable for voltages from 110V to 130V. You can push button with wet hands, but remember to clean the button when all finished. 【EXCELLENT COMPATIBILITY】Our air switch can complement any Modern or Traditional Kitchen Faucet Design, With Most Popular Finishes, polished and brushed, keep a consistency of style with your faucet and sink, each finishes also have SHORT and LONG length. It can work with any brand of garbage disposals(≤2HP), perfectly well for Waste King, InSinkErator, Moen, GE and so on. 【EXTENDED POWER LINE DESIGN】 With extend power line, no longer limited to the botton of the sink.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JWlQ058zL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CLEESINK","source_asin":"B079DMHKSL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-165641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079DMHKSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B079DMHKSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
