window.products.push({"id":165800,"name":"Upgraded WR60X25858 WR60X10340 Refrigerator Evaporator Fan Motor(OEM) Compatible with GE, Replace U11P14MS7AA3-57A61, PS12727431, AP6891698, 4931166,P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u0J3F5wzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💎 PRODUCT INFORMATION - WR60X25858 WR60X10340 evaporator fan motor Replacement models: U11P14MS7AA3-57A61, PD00054264, EAP12727431, PS12727431, AP6891698, 239D1371P002, 4931166,etc 💎PRODUCT FUNCTION - WR60X25858 WR60X10340 refrigerator fan motor circulates air through the fresh food compartment for efficient cooling.Perfectly fixes a series of problems such as abnormal refrigerator temperature and abnormal noise from the fan motor. Easy to install. You can fix it yourself, enjoy the joy of DIY repair. (Take photos of your unit prior to disassembly, it will save time during the reassembly) 💎COMPATIBLE MODELS-WR60X25858 evaporator fan motor Compatible models: DFE29JGDAWW GFE27GGDABB GFE27GGDAWW GFE29HGDABB GFE29HGDAWW GFE29HSDASS GNE26GGDABB GNE26GSDASS CFE28TP3MBD1 CFE28TP3MBW2 CFE28TP4MBW2 CFE28TSHBSS CFE28TSHCSS CFE28TSHDSS CFE28TSHESS CFE28TSHFSS CFE28TSHGSS CFE28TSHISS CFE28TSHJSS CFE28TSHKSS CFE28TSHLSS CFE28TSHMSS CFE28TSHNSS CFE28TSHOSS CFE28TSHPSS CFE28TSHQSS CFE28TSHRSS etc 💎 MAKES REFRIGERATOR RUN LIKE NEW - Fixes following symptoms: 1. Refrigerator isn't cooling; 2. Freezer section is cold but fridge is not; 3. Evaporator coils are covered in frost; (Frosty Evaporator Coils) 4. Icemaker not making ice; 5. Unusual loud noise from the freezer. 💎 EASY TO INSTALL - It only takes a few simple steps to complete the installation and tools needed for this repair project is just a screwdriver. First disconnect the power, then slide the crisper drawer out, remove the panel, pull the old fan out, and replace the new one. Repair refrigerator by yourself, you can save up to 90% of your budget compared to buying new one. Remember to unplug refrigerator from power source as a safety precaution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u0J3F5wzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PFCKE","source_asin":"B0BJL5F2FH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-165800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJL5F2FH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJL5F2FH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
