window.products.push({"id":165900,"name":"TangDepot, Set of 2 Soft Plush Velvet Big Striped Corduroy Solid Decorative Throw Pillow Covers, Square Pillow Covers - (18\"x18\" 2 Pieces, A10 Navy Bl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aCu-0jnPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity, Quality and Trademark: Pack of 2 TangDepot decorative throw pillow cover (NOTE: ONLY COVERS, INSERT NOT INCLUDED). TangDepot is a registered trademark. We bring you High Quality Soft Velvet Big Striped Corduroy Solid Pillow Covers at an Affordable Price. We use the most advanced sewing technology to produce the ideal throw pillow covers. It's made to last and doesn't lose its luxurious softness even after months of use. Size, Color & Design: 18\"x18\", A10 Navy Blue. Both the front and the back have the same color and velvet fabric. We use a Higher-than-industry standard production process. Each pillow case is 0.2 inch - 0.4 inch larger than the indicated size. CHOOSE THE RIGHT SIZE: 18x18 inch pillow covers / cousion covers are suitable for 18x18 inch (about 45cm x 45cm) pillow cores and 17x17 inch pillow cores, whether full or not full pillow inners Soft, Textured and Durable: luxurious plush velvet material for super softness. Made with color matching invisible zipper and allows easy insertion and removal of pillow inserts. All fabric edges are sewn with zigzag overlock stitch to prevent fray and ensure durability. EASY CARE - Machine wash cold, tumble dry on low temperature. Avoid direct heat. No Iron. Wash water does not fade. BROAD USE: TangDepot offer the most size options on the web, from 12 inch square to 28 inch square, and Rectangular lumbar pillow covers for a variety of application scenarios. The fabulous colors and embossed decorative throw pillow covers lets you effortlessly add a touch of luxury to your home decor. Feeling to your rooms making it the perfect decoration for your sofa, couch and bed. It also perfect gift for your family and friends. LIFETIME GUARANTEE - TangDepot provide the absolute best customer service in the industry, 100% customer satisfaction guaranteed or full refund. We love our customers and take pride in providing a pleasant shopping experience. If for any reason you decide that pillow covers you ordered are not for you, contact us and receive a 100% money-back refund, no questions asked (in fact, you do not even have to return the pillow covers). Try one and you will fall in love with this soft throw pillow cover","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91aCu-0jnPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TangDepot","source_asin":"B089NRXL87","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-165900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089NRXL87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089NRXL87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
