window.products.push({"id":165904,"name":"COSTWAY Set of 4 Metal Dining Chair, Patio Chairs with Stackable Design, Removable Backrest, Non-Slip Foot Pads, Anti-Rust Coating, Convenient to Stor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fH5C5RjWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌻4 PIECES TOLIX STYLE CHAIR------The 4-piece combination provides extra sitting space in the living room to meet the needs of multi-person gatherings. What's more, the Tolix style can add a sense of fashion to make these metal chairs stand out functionally and visually in restaurants or your home. 🌻STACKABLE DESIGN TO SAVE SPACE------Compared with ordinary accent chairs, this metal chair can be stacked on top of another to save space. The metal chair features a detachable backrest, which can be removed for storage when you don’t need it. It only takes up small space when stacked, which is very suitable for apartment, office, etc. 🌻HIGH BACKREST FOR MORE COMFORT------The chairs are designed to be both comfortable and as ergonomically correct as possible. With an inclined angle, the chair backrest can fit your back perfectly. Besides, the high backrest design can provide support for your back to relieve back fatigue. 🌻PREMIUM MATERIALS FOR BETTER DURABILITY------Coated with high-quality paint, these chairs are absolutely safe to use without odor. The coating can make the chair scratch-resistant, waterproof and rust-proof, and effectively extend the service life of the metal chair. At the same time, it makes the chair cleaning more effortlessly. 🌻USER FRIENDLY DESIGN------Sturdy X-shaped support increases the load-bearing capacity of the chair. Non-slip foot pads are dedicated to protecting the floor. Each metal dining chair is designed with multiple small holes on the surface, which can enhance ventilation to bring a more comfortable experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fH5C5RjWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B07DNN5BBJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-165904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DNN5BBJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DNN5BBJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
