window.products.push({"id":165906,"name":"BDI 8929 ES Avion Quad Media & TV Cabinet, Espresso Stained Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ff6m7CZDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The perfect media cabinet and TV stand for large home theater systems, packed with user-friendly features. BDI's award-winning Avion collection is engineered to delight AV enthusiasts and design connoisseurs alike. It’s beautiful furniture to be sure, but it’s what you don’t see that makes this collection a masterpiece. Signature features are built into the cabinet ensuring it performs almost as well as the electronics that it holds. From the Manufacturer The home theater has become a part of everyday home life. It’s where many hours are spent as family and friends come together for entertainment and relaxation. BDI Furniture merges innovative engineering and original design to seamlessly integrate today’s technology into the home. From the family room to the living room to the bedroom, there’s a BDI solution for any setting. The Avion Series II 8929 features a center drawer that can hold a speaker and media collection or can be removed for a larger speaker up to 8.25” tall The lower compartment features a flip down door for access to two component areas or stored media Fits flat-panel TVs up to 75\" Compliments any decor While beautiful, BDI furniture is more than meets the eye. Our home theater furniture is among the most thoroughly engineered furniture available today, designed to anticipate the needs of the most demanding home theater systems. Features such as adjustable shelves, cable management, speaker/media storage and hidden wheels provide simple setup, ease of use and lasting enjoyment.  These home theater cabinets ship almost completely assembled, requiring only minimal hardware installation by the user or installer. Packaging is environmentally conscious and thoroughly designed to ensure that everything arrives as expected. Sleek Design And Intelligent Features – It’s The Center Of Entertainment For larger systems, the Avion Series II Model 8929 provides an additional component compartment and greater width for larger TVs. The center drawer can accommodate a center channel speaker and media, or it can be removed to reveal an open shelf for larger speakers up to 8.25” tall. The side compartments feature an adjustable shelf that rests on threaded and cushioned shelf supports to minimize transmittal of vibrations. Quick-release door hinges, removable back panels and integrated cable management make for a simple setup. IR-friendly, grey tinted glass windows in the doors that allow for easy remote control access. The integrated wheels allow the entire cabinet to be rolled away from the wall and integrated levelers to compensate for uneven floors. Flow-through ventilation slots are machined into the bottom, shelves and back panels to facilitate cooling airflow, protecting components from overheating.  The Avion Series II is the ideal choice for flat panel TVs up to 75” and larger home theater systems, since it can accommodate up to 9 components. For an alternative mounting option, this model works well with BDI’s Arena Flat Panel TV Mount 9970 or 9972 (sold separately), which allows positioning the TV to stand even higher and adds swiveling for optimal viewing. Avion Series II 8929 Internal Dimensions Recommended TV Size: up to 75” flat-panel or rear projection TVs Recommended TV Size: up to 75” flat-panel or rear projection TVs Arena TV Mount Compatibility: 9970 and 9972 Arena TV Mount Compatibility: 9970 and 9972 Component Capacity: 6 - 9 Component Capacity: 6 - 9 Number of Adjustable Shelves: 2 Number of Adjustable Shelves: 2 Adjustable Shelf Increments: 1.25 in / 32 mm; 5 positions Adjustable Shelf Increments: 1.25 in / 32 mm; 5 positions Top Shelf Capacity: 200 lbs / 91 kg Top Shelf Capacity: 200 lbs / 91 kg A. Speaker/Media Drawer A. Speaker/Media Drawer Interior Dimensions (H x W x D): 7.25 x 34.5 x 15.5 in D / 18 x 88 x 39 cm Drawer Capacity: 40 lbs / 18 kg When Removed (H x W x D): 8.25 x 36.75 x 16.5 in D / 20 x 93 x 41 cm Drawer Capacity: 50 lbs / 23 kg B. Side Component Compartment B. Side Component Compartment Interior Dimensions (H x W x D): 16.25 x 18 x 20.5 / 41 x 46 x 52 cm Adjustable Shelf Capacity: 50 lbs / 23 kg Bottom Shelf Capacity: 75 lbs / 34 kg C. Center Component Compartment C. Center Component Compartment Interior Dimensions (H x W x D): 7 x 18 x 16.25 in / 18 x 46 x 41 cm Bottom Shelf Capacity: 75 lbs / 34 kg What’s in the Box Furniture, Instruction Sheet","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ff6m7CZDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BDI Furniture","source_asin":"B07L6JJS7Q","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-165906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L6JJS7Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L6JJS7Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
