window.products.push({"id":165968,"name":"8\" w X 8\" h Extruded Aluminum Adjustable Core Mount Supply Ceiling HVAC Air Grille – Interchangeable: 1-Way","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RIlTBfT0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"8\"w X 8\"h Is The Size For The Duct Opening Only, Dimensions With Outer End are 9.125\" X 9.125\" HVAC Premium has been providing superior in quality service for many many years. Our products are second to none, and we’ve helped numerous contractors, DIY projects, and home improvement remodeling specialists complete their masterpiece. If you are looking for a top of the line unit to enhance your project look no further than HVAC Premium. We have the largest selection of Grilles Registers & Diffusers. HVAC Premium has sold over 5,000,000 Grilles - We are proud of our many happy customers! You may think of grilles and registers as a generic component of the ventilation system in your house. But they are also the most visible representation of your air system. These grilles and registers give you an extra measure of quality that are visible to your family members and house guests.  Some of the best features aren't readily apparent, but you will appreciate the benefits over the period of time.  This grille has a high standard of design, production and finish on all products. Re-configurable/Interchangeable Sections – Easily Convertible Into 1-Way, 2-Way, 3 Way, or 4 Way – Just Lift Sections and Rotate to Re-Configure Direction. SEE PHOTOS FOR EXAMPLE Unrestricted Airflow For Your HVAC System - Full Control Directional Airflow Direction - Noise Free Components - No Vibrating Louvers Etc. How To Measure A Register Grille: Overall Size: MEASURE the size of the DUCT OPENING . Do not measure the old vent cover. If your duct opening is 14\" wide by 20\" tall, order a 14x20. 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed Don’t worry, you’re covered by our 100% money back guarantee no questions asked. Click Add to Cart Now! and enjoy a new updated refreshing look to your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RIlTBfT0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HVAC Premium","source_asin":"B0971L1M54","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-165968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0971L1M54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0971L1M54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
